          %h2#history History
          %p
            Historically the term ‘pseudofunctor’ was conceived by
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Grothendieck"} Grothendieck
            who weakened, around 1957, the concept of a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/contravariant+functor"} contravariant functor
            from a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/1-category"} 1-category
            to
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cat"} Cat
            = succeed "-category" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mn 1
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 1
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-category"} 2-category
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Cat
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Cat
            and allowing (contravariant) functoriality up to coherent
            = succeed "-cells." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mn 2
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 2
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bourbaki"} Bourbaki
            seminar on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/descent"} descent
            via pseudofunctors. Later in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SGA1"} SGA1
            Grothendieck (with the assistance of
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pierre+Gabriel"} Pierre Gabriel
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fibered+categories"} fibered categories
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Benabou"} Benabou
            %a{:href => "#Ben"} treatise
            introducing
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bicategories"} bicategories
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/function"} function
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/functor"} functor
            %li
              %p
